BT /F2 22.00 Tf 54.00 730.00 Td (Tactile Design System: Architecture, Current UI Surface, And Transition Strategy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 684.00 Td (Prepared for the Reaktor, BestBuds, and Reaktor Desktop codebase.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 660.00 Td (Date: 2026-04-14) Tj ET
BT /F2 16.00 Tf 54.00 626.00 Td (Executive Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 590.00 Td (The Tactile Design System should not be built as a static JSON server-driven UI system. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 576.00 Td (central architectural decision is that React becomes the programming model for dynamic UI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 562.00 Td (composition, while the Tactile host tree becomes an internal reconciler output. Product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 548.00 Td (engineers and AI agents should write React components, not JSON layout documents and not a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 534.00 Td (partial expression language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 510.00 Td (The target model is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 473.00 Td (React components) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 462.00 Td (  -> custom React reconciler) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 451.00 Td (  -> TactileHostTree) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 440.00 Td (  -> Reaktor FFI bridge) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 429.00 Td (  -> StateFlow<TactileHostNode>) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 418.00 Td (  -> TactileComposeRenderer) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 407.00 Td (  -> Compose Multiplatform) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 371.00 Td (For React-native terminal targets, the path is simpler:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 334.00 Td (React components) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 323.00 Td (  -> @reaktor/tactile-rsd) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 312.00 Td (  -> React Strict DOM) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 68.00 301.00 Td (  -> DOM / React Native) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 265.00 Td (The Tactile host tree is an implementation detail. It is similar in role to a shadow tree or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 251.00 Td (host tree in other renderer systems. It is not a public schema language. Its purpose is to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 237.00 Td (make the React composition model renderable through the native Compose Multiplatform design) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 223.00 Td (system.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 199.00 Td (Reaktor Graph remains the app orchestration layer. It should continue to own navigation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 185.00 Td (route payloads, graph ports, dependency scopes, services, repositories, and app lifecycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 171.00 Td (Tactile should plug into graph rendering as a sibling to the current ComposeContent path,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 157.00 Td (not replace the graph runtime.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 133.00 Td (BestBuds mobile should be the first product transition target. The transition should begin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 119.00 Td (with leaf components and product design tokens, not whole screens. Reaktor Desktop should be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 105.00 Td (upgraded later as tooling for host-tree inspection, component catalogues, skin switching,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 91.00 Td (and route preview.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 286.00 28.00 Td (1 / 23) Tj ET
