BT /F2 16.00 Tf 54.00 726.00 Td (Why Not Static SDUI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 690.00 Td (Static SDUI systems often start with a clean idea: the server sends a tree of UI components,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 676.00 Td (and the client renders those components. This is safe, inspectable, and easy to cache at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 662.00 Td (beginning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 638.00 Td (The problem is that real product UI quickly needs features that are not simply a tree:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 615.00 Td (- conditionals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 600.00 Td (- loops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 585.00 Td (- local state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 570.00 Td (- form binding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 555.00 Td (- validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 540.00 Td (- optimistic updates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 525.00 Td (- loading states) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 510.00 Td (- effects and lifecycle) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 495.00 Td (- component composition) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 480.00 Td (- feature flags and experiments) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 465.00 Td (- navigation actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 450.00 Td (- cross-component coordination) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 426.00 Td (When those needs appear, a static SDUI system tends to grow a partial programming language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 412.00 Td (JSON receives fields like `visibleWhen`, `forEach`, `bind`, `onChange`, `validate`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 398.00 Td (`computed`, and `action`. The design then becomes a custom language without the tooling,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 384.00 Td (debuggability, libraries, and mental model of a real programming language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 360.00 Td (The second failure mode is separation. Logic becomes split between the SDUI document,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 346.00 Td (server-side builders, and client widgets. It becomes unclear whether behavior belongs in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 332.00 Td (schema or in the widget. Different widgets start interpreting similar configuration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 318.00 Td (differently. The server begins to depend on client implementation quirks, and clients begin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 304.00 Td (to encode product-specific behavior in generic widgets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 280.00 Td (The Tactile approach should avoid this. React is already a complete component language. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 266.00 Td (has functions, conditionals, loops, composition, local state, effects, context, and mature) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 252.00 Td (tooling. The reconciler can make React target Reaktor's native Compose runtime without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 238.00 Td (inventing another programming language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 214.00 Td (This does not mean JSON or FlexBuffers disappear. They may still exist as internal encodings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 200.00 Td (for the reconciler commit protocol. The difference is that the authoring model is not JSON.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 186.00 Td (The authoring model is React.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16.00 Tf 54.00 152.00 Td (Target Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 116.00 Td (The system has four major runtime surfaces:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 93.00 Td (1. React composition surface.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 66.00 78.00 Td (2. Tactile host tree and reconciler bridge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 286.00 28.00 Td (2 / 23) Tj ET
Q
