BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 320.00 Td (feel slow and fragile. Native tactile effects must remain native.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 296.00 Td (The biggest graph risk is trying to replace Reaktor Graph with renderer navigation. Compose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 282.00 Td (Adaptive and RSD layouts should present panes; Reaktor Graph should continue to own semantic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 268.00 Td (navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 54.00 244.00 Td (The biggest tooling risk is waiting too long to inspect host trees. The desktop workbench) Tj ET
